{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012518001:0":{"text":"빛나는 꽃이 드디어 나타났어요... 솔직히 마음속으로 계속 중얼거렸거든요.","source_cn":"荧荧花终于出现了……讲实话我心里一直在嘀咕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2096DFE6ABC1955D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012518002:0":{"text":"중얼거리는 버릇은 어렸을 때부터 변함이 없네.","source_cn":"碎碎念，和小时候真是一点儿也没变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C2611DD0D774CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012518003:0":{"text":"아니야, 누나, 난 그저 몬스터가 제대로 제거되지 않았을까 봐 걱정한 것 뿐이라고.","source_cn":"不是的姐，我只是担心魔物没有清理干净。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835C041A6F2809F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}